    "problemName": "palindrome-number",
    "language": "python3",
    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def isPalindrome(self, x: int) -> bool:\r\n        if x < 0 or (x and x % 10 == 0):\r\n            return False\r\n        y = 0\r\n        while y < x:\r\n            y = y * 10 + x % 10\r\n            x //= 10\r\n        return x in (y, y // 10)",
